  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fostering a media inter-cultural exchange as a milestone towards a reconciliation process between Kosovo* and Serbia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;This project is in line with the overall objective of the call as it supports &#xBF;vision of enhanced regional cooperation, good neighbourly relations and reconciliation&#xBF; through strengthening media contribution to these processes. The proposed Action is designed to increase information flow and access to information that promotes intercultural and interethnic cooperation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The proposed Action also refers to the specific goals of this Call, especially points 2, 3 and 4, as it combines resource sharing, networking and increased capacities of journalists to produce quality and pluralistic media content, in line with the enhanced neighbourly relations between Serbia and Kosovo&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
